VulkanPMap (pm::)

GPU photon emission, compact grid indexing, multi-bounce diffuse GI,
dielectric sphere transport, caustics and progressive surface caches.
Adaptive direct area-light shadows, variance-aware filtering, temporal
reprojection and denoising produce an HDR output.
Public API: pmap/pmap.hpp; shaders: shaders/.
Host owns VulkanWrapper, command buffers, camera and presentation.
